Subject: Cantor Attention Manifest Refresh P6 Solution

@ [solution_uuid] eec5d462-a8fd-4baf-9d91-80180e47ac00

& [ImplementedSolution]
  + a complete compact manifest carries stable identity type label version and digest beside the unchanged full register
  + exact object bodies are materialized only for one bounded explicit handle selection
  + one full-coverage receipt records Relevant NotApplicable or Unresolved for every manifest member and binds relevance to materialized bodies
  + the pure host recomputes every read against the current durable head and the MCP returns without persistence or mutation

& [Meaning]
  + Cantor now has a two-tier inference workspace: persistent complete identity awareness and selective exact detail
  + the receipt makes declared attention accounting inspectable but does not prove internal model attention truth verification or effect authority
